            <description><![CDATA[<p class="jarvis-headline">Smaller meeting pills that fold out of your way.</p>
<h2>Jarvis 0.20.24</h2>
<ul>
  <li>"Take notes" is smaller, slides in from the right, and shows a green ring for the 10 seconds you have to say yes. A small ✕ closes it for the rest of the call.</li>
  <li>If you don't answer, it turns into a small sleeping owl you can hover to bring it back.</li>
  <li>Pressing "Take notes" now turns straight into the recording pill, with no empty beat in between.</li>
  <li>A few seconds into a recording, the pill folds down to the owl with a red dot. Hover it to see the time and Stop.</li>
  <li>The pointer now shows a hand over the pills, even while your call is in front.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
